(3025081, 426075, 60141, '<td valign="top">This shot is a nice attempt to capture an environmental portrait of this worker.  I''m not sure the lighting works well, it''s quite flat and the levels of the picture are very flat -- boosting the contrast might have helped this picture pop.  Also, I''d stay away from putting her eyes dead in the center of the pic, try cropping so they are 1/3 down from the top.  Finally, be willing to show us more of her environment (is it a bakery?) so tell us more about where she works.</td>', 'This shot is a nice attempt to capture an environmental portrait of this worker.  I''m not sure the lighting works well, it''s quite flat and the levels of the picture are very flat -- boosting the contrast might have helped this picture pop.  Also, I''d stay away from putting her eyes dead in the center of the pic, try cropping so they are 1/3 down from the top.  Finally, be willing to show us more of her environment (is it a bakery?) so tell us more about where she works.', '2006-11-13 00:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3025091, 426738, 66515, '<td valign="top">I like this picture. The focus is on her hair unfortunately rather than those pretty eyes.</td>', 'I like this picture. The focus is on her hair unfortunately rather than those pretty eyes.', '2006-11-13 00:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3025095, 426071, 67145, '<td valign="top">i love the crisp look to this photo ... and i know exactly where it is !! .........really good how you got the australian flag in the shot .. just noticed the other one on the bridge ... cool .......</td>', 'i love the crisp look to this photo ... and i know exactly where it is !! .........really good how you got the australian flag in the shot .. just noticed the other one on the bridge ... cool .......', '2006-11-13 00:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
