(3026459, 426358, 64175, '<td valign="top">I love this photo. Great shot. I might suggest a little more crop (down just to above his head) as the bright spot behind his head detracts just a little from the subject.  9.</td>', 'I love this photo. Great shot. I might suggest a little more crop (down just to above his head) as the bright spot behind his head detracts just a little from the subject.  9.', '2006-11-13 11:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
