(3026990, 426756, 42181, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the border but I guess it will get a 50 / 50 responce. However the picture is great. 7</td>', 'I''m not sure about the border but I guess it will get a 50 / 50 responce. However the picture is great. 7', '2006-11-13 13:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3026991, 426105, 58330, '<td valign="top">Just a bit too blown out on the left cheek and part of the banana, but an amusing photo nonetheless. Great hair and eyes give this an Einstein look and makes me want to look a little longer.7</td>', 'Just a bit too blown out on the left cheek and part of the banana, but an amusing photo nonetheless. Great hair and eyes give this an Einstein look and makes me want to look a little longer.7', '2006-11-13 13:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3026994, 425731, 5792, '<td valign="top">Superb expression capture. Well done. The shadow on the lower right is a distraction, especially since your model''s arm directs attention to it..</td>', 'Superb expression capture. Well done. The shadow on the lower right is a distraction, especially since your model''s arm directs attention to it..', '2006-11-13 13:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
