(3027200, 425297, 5792, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones, fantastic technical quality and sharpness, composed exceptionally well. What more could you ask of a B&amp;W in order to score it 10?</td>', 'Beautiful tones, fantastic technical quality and sharpness, composed exceptionally well. What more could you ask of a B&W in order to score it 10?', '2006-11-13 14:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
