(3027494, 426746, 5354, '<td valign="top">Nice detail, nice repetition. Not sure it stands up as an image against some of the other entries</td>', 'Nice detail, nice repetition. Not sure it stands up as an image against some of the other entries', '2006-11-13 15:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027496, 426779, 64175, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field on this one. One thing that might have conveyed the "hungry" title is if the child was staring directly at it and may have even had a hand coming towards it.  The child seems to be looking away from the food. 5.</td>', 'Nice depth of field on this one. One thing that might have conveyed the "hungry" title is if the child was staring directly at it and may have even had a hand coming towards it.  The child seems to be looking away from the food. 5.', '2006-11-13 16:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027498, 426255, 5354, '<td valign="top">I know this is basic edit rules, but this image suffers from converging verticals and a curved baseline. It suffers quite badly. The tonal range is also quite low, making the image a little dull.</td>', 'I know this is basic edit rules, but this image suffers from converging verticals and a curved baseline. It suffers quite badly. The tonal range is also quite low, making the image a little dull.', '2006-11-13 16:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027501, 425522, 64175, '<td valign="top">I''m not very sophisticated with post processing ,but I might suggest playing with this just a bit more in the channel mixer or something as the image comes off a little flat IMO. 5.</td>', 'I''m not very sophisticated with post processing ,but I might suggest playing with this just a bit more in the channel mixer or something as the image comes off a little flat IMO. 5.', '2006-11-13 16:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027502, 425828, 5354, '<td valign="top">Would like to have seen this further over to the left, almost unbalancing the composition.</td>', 'Would like to have seen this further over to the left, almost unbalancing the composition.', '2006-11-13 16:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027509, 426545, 64175, '<td valign="top">This is a great composition. I had to come back to it and am bumping it from a 5 to a 7. I like the leading affect it has on the viewer with its nice curves in the foreground. The little tunnels in the back actually take away something from the photo, IMO, but if you cropped them out, then you lose most of that nice rock on the right.  7.</td>', 'This is a great composition. I had to come back to it and am bumping it from a 5 to a 7. I like the leading affect it has on the viewer with its nice curves in the foreground. The little tunnels in the back actually take away something from the photo, IMO, but if you cropped them out, then you lose most of that nice rock on the right.  7.', '2006-11-13 16:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027512, 425526, 5354, '<td valign="top">Excellent tones. I feel that big heavy post could be almost up against the left of the frame, then have the fence line run out a little more</td>', 'Excellent tones. I feel that big heavy post could be almost up against the left of the frame, then have the fence line run out a little more', '2006-11-13 16:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3027516, 426037, 5354, '<td valign="top">I guess everyone has mentioned the glare and the flair. I''m going to concentrate on the building. My pet hate is images of buildings where the camera is pointed up cropping of any ''base''. This composition rarely works, this is no exception.</td>', 'I guess everyone has mentioned the glare and the flair. I''m going to concentrate on the building. My pet hate is images of buildings where the camera is pointed up cropping of any ''base''. This composition rarely works, this is no exception.', '2006-11-13 16:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
