(3027805, 426228, 23300, '<td valign="top">This is a really beautiful example of a classic style. It looks like it is right off the cover of a seveties LP record. Really natural model and wonderful composition. The trees leading off in the background are perfect and the bokeh is excellent. The foreground detail really enhances the image also. This, to me, is one of those images that just works. The technical details pale into insignificance compared to the emotional power and strong composition. Good Luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a really beautiful example of a classic style. It looks like it is right off the cover of a seveties LP record. Really natural model and wonderful composition. The trees leading off in the background are perfect and the bokeh is excellent. The foreground detail really enhances the image also. This, to me, is one of those images that just works. The technical details pale into insignificance compared to the emotional power and strong composition. Good Luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-13 17:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
