(3028165, 425731, 29011, '<td valign="top">Easily one of my favorite portraits from the challenge. The tones here are excellent. The ballerina does look a little sad but charming. One nitpick is the dark square near the bottom right, could be easily cloned out but not certain if it would be removal of a major element, sorta doubt it but better safe I guess. I should know hehe. Another is this shot has a sephia tint, not purely b/w. I hope you dont get voted down because it looks great in b/w but if I had to choose I''d choose this slightly toned one.</td>', 'Easily one of my favorite portraits from the challenge. The tones here are excellent. The ballerina does look a little sad but charming. One nitpick is the dark square near the bottom right, could be easily cloned out but not certain if it would be removal of a major element, sorta doubt it but better safe I guess. I should know hehe. Another is this shot has a sephia tint, not purely b/w. I hope you dont get voted down because it looks great in b/w but if I had to choose I''d choose this slightly toned one.', '2006-11-13 19:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028166, 426672, 23300, '<td valign="top">A great combination of sound photographic concepts; composition, light, form, exposure, texture, depth of field. All put together in a classic style with a touch of nuance to top it off. I bet that you and the model are both very happy with this image. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'A great combination of sound photographic concepts; composition, light, form, exposure, texture, depth of field. All put together in a classic style with a touch of nuance to top it off. I bet that you and the model are both very happy with this image. Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-13 19:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028167, 426072, 29011, '<td valign="top">a 10! :D Perfect contrast, composition and work with light and texture.</td>', 'a 10! :D Perfect contrast, composition and work with light and texture.', '2006-11-13 19:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028171, 425815, 38032, '<td valign="top">amazing detail</td>', 'amazing detail', '2006-11-13 19:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028172, 426348, 38032, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful in many ways ... the position just seems a bit forced. 7</td>', 'This is beautiful in many ways ... the position just seems a bit forced. 7', '2006-11-13 19:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028174, 426149, 38032, '<td valign="top">that works</td>', 'that works', '2006-11-13 19:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028177, 425757, 38032, '<td valign="top">scary looking - i wouldn''t be upping these</td>', 'scary looking - i wouldn''t be upping these', '2006-11-13 19:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028183, 426578, 46177, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast and tones, I think I would have liked to see more of the ceiling but still well done.</td>', 'Nice contrast and tones, I think I would have liked to see more of the ceiling but still well done.', '2006-11-13 19:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028185, 426409, 46177, '<td valign="top">Very nice soft portrait, does well conveying emotion, nice focus on the eye and lashes.</td>', 'Very nice soft portrait, does well conveying emotion, nice focus on the eye and lashes.', '2006-11-13 19:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028186, 425706, 58247, '<td valign="top">Nice Capture. The light quality is very nice.</td>', 'Nice Capture. The light quality is very nice.', '2006-11-13 19:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028187, 425212, 46177, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast in tones on the rocks, I think the water could have had a little more impact, perhaps with some highlights.</td>', 'Nice contrast in tones on the rocks, I think the water could have had a little more impact, perhaps with some highlights.', '2006-11-13 19:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028188, 426595, 58247, '<td valign="top">I really like the reflection in the water. Tonal quality is good too.</td>', 'I really like the reflection in the water. Tonal quality is good too.', '2006-11-13 19:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028189, 425734, 46177, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and composition, Great tonal range, overall a really appealing image.</td>', 'Nice angle and composition, Great tonal range, overall a really appealing image.', '2006-11-13 19:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028190, 425658, 58247, '<td valign="top">Nice image! The dramatic sky is relly working here!</td>', 'Nice image! The dramatic sky is relly working here!', '2006-11-13 19:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028192, 424860, 46177, '<td valign="top">Really expresses emotion to me, nicely done.  The lone figure under the spotlight says it all.</td>', 'Really expresses emotion to me, nicely done.  The lone figure under the spotlight says it all.', '2006-11-13 19:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028196, 426662, 46177, '<td valign="top">Thats definatley black and white, great contrast and highlights, just not sure about the crop or where the leg is placed in the picture, I think I would have liked to see a bit more space on the left.</td>', 'Thats definatley black and white, great contrast and highlights, just not sure about the crop or where the leg is placed in the picture, I think I would have liked to see a bit more space on the left.', '2006-11-13 20:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028198, 426660, 46177, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and of course the beautiful contrast of pure white against pure black, really has high impact.  I wish the feather was slightly sharper but actually here I think that is just a small thing.</td>', 'I like the composition and of course the beautiful contrast of pure white against pure black, really has high impact.  I wish the feather was slightly sharper but actually here I think that is just a small thing.', '2006-11-13 20:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028201, 425706, 2382, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot... glad you had a camera and not a gun!  How long did you sit waiting for this?</td>', 'Beautiful shot... glad you had a camera and not a gun!  How long did you sit waiting for this?', '2006-11-13 20:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028202, 425757, 46177, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast and tones the stairs really are the focal point. Well done.</td>', 'Nice contrast and tones the stairs really are the focal point. Well done.', '2006-11-13 20:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028205, 424939, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very nice dramatic sky with good contrast and detail and gull flying. Generally well done. Foreground basically OK but might be nicer with more foreground interest. Unfortunately the horizon is not level which is a major distraction to the viewer.</td>', 'Very nice dramatic sky with good contrast and detail and gull flying. Generally well done. Foreground basically OK but might be nicer with more foreground interest. Unfortunately the horizon is not level which is a major distraction to the viewer.', '2006-11-13 20:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028209, 426710, 2382, '<td valign="top">wonderful framing and range of shades.</td>', 'wonderful framing and range of shades.', '2006-11-13 20:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028213, 426614, 2382, '<td valign="top">nice composition but the contrast seems too low for my taste.</td>', 'nice composition but the contrast seems too low for my taste.', '2006-11-13 20:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028218, 425946, 23300, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this is very effective and the photo well executed. The composition is strong and it works well in black and white. The only thing that doesn''t grab me is that it doesn''t quite portray enough dynamics or action. The guys all look like they were hanging there for a while waiting for the photo to be taken. This may have been your intention but I feel it gives the image a strange static feel that detracts from the potential power of the image. The image has great technical merit overall. Good Luck with the challenge.</td>', 'The lighting on this is very effective and the photo well executed. The composition is strong and it works well in black and white. The only thing that doesn''t grab me is that it doesn''t quite portray enough dynamics or action. The guys all look like they were hanging there for a while waiting for the photo to be taken. This may have been your intention but I feel it gives the image a strange static feel that detracts from the potential power of the image. The image has great technical merit overall. Good Luck with the challenge.', '2006-11-13 20:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028223, 426192, 56254, '<td valign="top">great shot ... needs a big boost of contrast IMHO ...</td>', 'great shot ... needs a big boost of contrast IMHO ...', '2006-11-13 20:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028225, 426526, 2382, '<td valign="top">very nice picture!  Wonderful contrasts and clarity.  Not to mention a beautiful model as well!  I don''t understand your title.</td>', 'very nice picture!  Wonderful contrasts and clarity.  Not to mention a beautiful model as well!  I don''t understand your title.', '2006-11-13 20:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028226, 426093, 2382, '<td valign="top">ouch!  I hope that''s make up!</td>', 'ouch!  I hope that''s make up!', '2006-11-13 20:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028230, 426635, 46177, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, great tones, especially the different shades of black.  Like the angle its taken from.</td>', 'Nice capture, great tones, especially the different shades of black.  Like the angle its taken from.', '2006-11-13 20:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028233, 426694, 2382, '<td valign="top">interesting pose... i don''t understand the title.</td>', 'interesting pose... i don''t understand the title.', '2006-11-13 20:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028236, 426348, 46177, '<td valign="top">Very different, great idea for a picture, works well with the different tones in this room.  Having the model look so vuneralble definatley enhances the mood created.</td>', 'Very different, great idea for a picture, works well with the different tones in this room.  Having the model look so vuneralble definatley enhances the mood created.', '2006-11-13 20:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028237, 426343, 2382, '<td valign="top">lovely!</td>', 'lovely!', '2006-11-13 20:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028241, 426358, 46177, '<td valign="top">I really like this one and am back to bump it up, very expressive face and lovely tones on his coat.  The light area above him almost looks like he has a halo or a glow behind him, either way I find it works well, very serene.</td>', 'I really like this one and am back to bump it up, very expressive face and lovely tones on his coat.  The light area above him almost looks like he has a halo or a glow behind him, either way I find it works well, very serene.', '2006-11-13 20:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3028255, 425756, 56254, '<td valign="top">I think that this shot would benefit from a big boost in contrast ... love his expression though ...</td>', 'I think that this shot would benefit from a big boost in contrast ... love his expression though ...', '2006-11-13 20:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
