(3029106, 426464, 47316, '<td valign="top">Beautiful concept though the right arm seems awkward. I think it might have looked nice with their hands closer to the top of the flower and a more square crop. I dunno. Really great though.</td>', 'Beautiful concept though the right arm seems awkward. I think it might have looked nice with their hands closer to the top of the flower and a more square crop. I dunno. Really great though.', '2006-11-14 02:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029108, 426780, 47316, '<td valign="top">The patterns in the smoke are interesting but I feel as though the photo is lacking something. It''s not really grabbing me. Perhaps the origin of the smoke included in the photo? I''m not sure.</td>', 'The patterns in the smoke are interesting but I feel as though the photo is lacking something. It''s not really grabbing me. Perhaps the origin of the smoke included in the photo? I''m not sure.', '2006-11-14 02:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
