(3029118, 425960, 47316, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I find the background distracting however because of the dark blacks and light whites. I think having her a little more towards the center might be helpful because where she is now it seems that your eye is tugging back and forth between her and the background.</td>', 'Beautiful. I find the background distracting however because of the dark blacks and light whites. I think having her a little more towards the center might be helpful because where she is now it seems that your eye is tugging back and forth between her and the background.', '2006-11-14 02:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
