(3029651, 426629, 31399, '<td valign="top">very nice idea.  storms coming?lol.  I''d like to see tad more selective color to darken the blacks and perhaps eliminate some of the black tone in whites.  gl 7</td>', 'very nice idea.  storms coming?lol.  I''d like to see tad more selective color to darken the blacks and perhaps eliminate some of the black tone in whites.  gl 7', '2006-11-14 09:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029654, 425971, 32767, '<td valign="top">I like this shot but there''s something odd about it texturally speaking. My guess is it''s been over noise-reduced where it doesn''t look like it had enough noise to fret about in the first place. I might have shifted the crop to the right of his/her face since he/she''s facing right.  Just my opinion. Good Luck!</td>', 'I like this shot but there''s something odd about it texturally speaking. My guess is it''s been over noise-reduced where it doesn''t look like it had enough noise to fret about in the first place. I might have shifted the crop to the right of his/her face since he/she''s facing right.  Just my opinion. Good Luck!', '2006-11-14 09:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029657, 426211, 31399, '<td valign="top">wow nice horse! Arabian? muzzle/head sure looks like it.  What a beauty.  perhaps darken the blacks in selective color a tad? gl</td>', 'wow nice horse! Arabian? muzzle/head sure looks like it.  What a beauty.  perhaps darken the blacks in selective color a tad? gl', '2006-11-14 09:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029662, 426123, 31399, '<td valign="top">seems almost sepia in tone and not as much B/w.  perhaps selectively darken the blacks and lighten the whites? try channels on this.  we lived in the desert and i love adobe style.  gl 7</td>', 'seems almost sepia in tone and not as much B/w.  perhaps selectively darken the blacks and lighten the whites? try channels on this.  we lived in the desert and i love adobe style.  gl 7', '2006-11-14 09:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
