(3030840, 426756, 24454, '<td valign="top">I like this alot.   It has a greeting card kind of feel for me for some reason.  I''ve always loved compositions with old fences in pastoral country scenes.  Nice light and shadows!</td>', 'I like this alot.   It has a greeting card kind of feel for me for some reason.  I''ve always loved compositions with old fences in pastoral country scenes.  Nice light and shadows!', '2006-11-14 15:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3030846, 425893, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  I love the 3-dimensional quality against that soft gray bokeh background. Good luck.</td>', 'This is beautiful.  I love the 3-dimensional quality against that soft gray bokeh background. Good luck.', '2006-11-14 15:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3030852, 423833, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful!   I love the composition and the drama of that dreamy water over the sand and rocks.  Excellent photography!</td>', 'This is beautiful!   I love the composition and the drama of that dreamy water over the sand and rocks.  Excellent photography!', '2006-11-14 15:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3030854, 426459, 58610, '<td valign="top">High contrast subject doesn''t make for a great B&amp;W photo. If you had zoomed in tight on the magnifier perhaps you could have found your middle tones.</td>', 'High contrast subject doesn''t make for a great B&W photo. If you had zoomed in tight on the magnifier perhaps you could have found your middle tones.', '2006-11-14 15:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3030857, 425778, 24454, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition.  I love the motion shown by the moving wings, and the eye contact of the bird.  Really cool photo.</td>', 'Beautiful composition.  I love the motion shown by the moving wings, and the eye contact of the bird.  Really cool photo.', '2006-11-14 15:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3030865, 423588, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is a great portrait of that beautiful animal, but cage makes me sad :(  The detail on the face is awesome, and so is the exposure.  Great job.</td>', 'This is a great portrait of that beautiful animal, but cage makes me sad :(  The detail on the face is awesome, and so is the exposure.  Great job.', '2006-11-14 15:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3030868, 425658, 24454, '<td valign="top">How pretty and dramatic!  Ijust love this photo!</td>', 'How pretty and dramatic!  Ijust love this photo!', '2006-11-14 15:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3030869, 426748, 58610, '<td valign="top">This could be <i>very</i> interesting if you expose for the inside of the window frame. If you shot in Raw you could layer two copies - one adjusted for the inside exposure and one for the outside.</td>', 'This could be very interesting if you expose for the inside of the window frame. If you shot in Raw you could layer two copies - one adjusted for the inside exposure and one for the outside.', '2006-11-14 15:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3030873, 426552, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh, I LOVE this one!  The amazing precision of those marchers and their rifles gives such a noble feel to the photo.  Excellent choice for a black and white photo -- it adds even more drama!</td>', 'Oh, I LOVE this one!  The amazing precision of those marchers and their rifles gives such a noble feel to the photo.  Excellent choice for a black and white photo -- it adds even more drama!', '2006-11-14 15:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3030877, 426424, 24454, '<td valign="top">Hey. . .that''s not black and white.  I see red lips and flesh-toned ears.   Hmmmmmm.    Interesting photo tho for sure.</td>', 'Hey. . .that''s not black and white.  I see red lips and flesh-toned ears.   Hmmmmmm.    Interesting photo tho for sure.', '2006-11-14 15:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3030878, 426675, 58610, '<td valign="top">Whoooooooooaaaaaaaaa. I feel a little vertigo.  Very nice. Looks like you used a polorizer to bring down the sky? Nice details in the shadows and in the highlights as well.</td>', 'Whoooooooooaaaaaaaaa. I feel a little vertigo.  Very nice. Looks like you used a polorizer to bring down the sky? Nice details in the shadows and in the highlights as well.', '2006-11-14 15:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3030882, 425797, 24454, '<td valign="top">Aww how cute!  I wish I was there and could share my carrots with him :)   I love this!</td>', 'Aww how cute!  I wish I was there and could share my carrots with him :)   I love this!', '2006-11-14 15:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3030888, 426680, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is so cool!   It''s great on impact when it pops up on your screen, but then when you notice the minimalist little bird on the ledge it adds even more interest and a little touch of softness to a very bold, dramatic composition.   I just love it!</td>', 'This is so cool!   It''s great on impact when it pops up on your screen, but then when you notice the minimalist little bird on the ledge it adds even more interest and a little touch of softness to a very bold, dramatic composition.   I just love it!', '2006-11-14 15:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3030895, 426629, 58610, '<td valign="top">Good timing. I like the way the clouds echo the movement and shape of your flying leaves (or visa versa).The oak tree seems oldly small in relation to your subject. Maybe just a variety I''ve never experienced.</td>', 'Good timing. I like the way the clouds echo the movement and shape of your flying leaves (or visa versa).The oak tree seems oldly small in relation to your subject. Maybe just a variety I''ve never experienced.', '2006-11-14 15:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3030898, 426582, 58610, '<td valign="top">Wonderful detail and focus. I can almost feel the texture.</td>', 'Wonderful detail and focus. I can almost feel the texture.', '2006-11-14 15:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3030901, 426612, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is really cool. ..unfortunately, I have to mark you down because I now have a sweet tooth and will probably go indulge myself and it''s all your fault for having such an enticing photo  :)  (juuuuuuuust kidding!!!!!)<br/> <br/>I really do like it alot.  It''s clean and sharp, and the composition of the cookie being half eaten is perfect!   A genius display of creativity in taking the simple and making it awesome!</td>', 'This is really cool. ..unfortunately, I have to mark you down because I now have a sweet tooth and will probably go indulge myself and it''s all your fault for having such an enticing photo  :)  (juuuuuuuust kidding!!!!!) I really do like it alot.  It''s clean and sharp, and the composition of the cookie being half eaten is perfect!   A genius display of creativity in taking the simple and making it awesome!', '2006-11-14 15:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3030903, 426458, 52549, '<td valign="top">Wonderful clarity and a great title.</td>', 'Wonderful clarity and a great title.', '2006-11-14 15:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3030905, 426575, 24454, '<td valign="top">You did a great job on this.  It''s so clean and sharp.  And exposed perefctly!</td>', 'You did a great job on this.  It''s so clean and sharp.  And exposed perefctly!', '2006-11-14 15:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3030909, 426505, 52549, '<td valign="top">I love the detail in this shot and the nostalgic feeling it brings over. Hope it does well for you.</td>', 'I love the detail in this shot and the nostalgic feeling it brings over. Hope it does well for you.', '2006-11-14 15:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3030912, 424249, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is really lovely!  You did such a fantastic job with the soft dreamy background and making your subject pop right off the page.  Beautiful work!</td>', 'This is really lovely!  You did such a fantastic job with the soft dreamy background and making your subject pop right off the page.  Beautiful work!', '2006-11-14 15:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3030913, 426496, 58610, '<td valign="top">Sky and water reflections are a little overblown. Your focus and dof are very good. Subject is not the most imaginative. Someone walking down the pier would have added a lot of interest.</td>', 'Sky and water reflections are a little overblown. Your focus and dof are very good. Subject is not the most imaginative. Someone walking down the pier would have added a lot of interest.', '2006-11-14 15:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3030916, 426563, 52549, '<td valign="top">Great shot - the whites are amazing.</td>', 'Great shot - the whites are amazing.', '2006-11-14 15:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3030917, 425793, 24454, '<td valign="top">I just love photos like this with a strong pretty subject and lots of negative space at the top.  And cows are one of my favorite subjects too :)</td>', 'I just love photos like this with a strong pretty subject and lots of negative space at the top.  And cows are one of my favorite subjects too :)', '2006-11-14 15:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3030924, 426109, 24454, '<td valign="top">EXCELLENT emotional composition!  I wish the baby was a tiny bit sharper, but everything else is so perfect about this photo it really makes up for any slight technical imperfections in my opinion!</td>', 'EXCELLENT emotional composition!  I wish the baby was a tiny bit sharper, but everything else is so perfect about this photo it really makes up for any slight technical imperfections in my opinion!', '2006-11-14 16:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3030928, 426762, 58610, '<td valign="top">I like the juxtaposition of the sailors against your subject. She seems a little washed out while they appear sharp. I think your focal plane was just behind her. Great reflections in the windows. Good overall exposure with wide tonal range.</td>', 'I like the juxtaposition of the sailors against your subject. She seems a little washed out while they appear sharp. I think your focal plane was just behind her. Great reflections in the windows. Good overall exposure with wide tonal range.', '2006-11-14 16:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3030930, 425946, 24454, '<td valign="top">This looks like a very cool album cover!  I like it alot!</td>', 'This looks like a very cool album cover!  I like it alot!', '2006-11-14 16:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3030935, 426445, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is AWESOME!   What an incredible focus for such a fast moving scene!  You totally rock!</td>', 'This is AWESOME!   What an incredible focus for such a fast moving scene!  You totally rock!', '2006-11-14 16:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3030936, 426640, 58610, '<td valign="top">Your title took my eye right to the holes in the wall. This has a very abandoned/industrial look which I like. Could be a little deeper dof for me.</td>', 'Your title took my eye right to the holes in the wall. This has a very abandoned/industrial look which I like. Could be a little deeper dof for me.', '2006-11-14 16:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3030938, 426743, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwww. . .I love this photo!!!   He looks like he''s in totally contented bliss.  Powerfully emotional for a psycho animal lover like me :)</td>', 'Awwww. . .I love this photo!!!   He looks like he''s in totally contented bliss.  Powerfully emotional for a psycho animal lover like me :)', '2006-11-14 16:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
