(3030997, 425153, 46177, '<td valign="top">The eyes are beautiful and the composition is great, the only problem is the left side is blown out on the face and some streaks in the hair.  Hair on the right has nice detail. Very nice crop and angle of the face.  If the left side wasn''t blown out I would have given this top score.  Still a nice portrait though.</td>', 'The eyes are beautiful and the composition is great, the only problem is the left side is blown out on the face and some streaks in the hair.  Hair on the right has nice detail. Very nice crop and angle of the face.  If the left side wasn''t blown out I would have given this top score.  Still a nice portrait though.', '2006-11-14 16:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3031002, 424715, 46177, '<td valign="top">Nice sky but I am not to sure about the highlights in the middle they don''t look quite natural and its a little to dark up front.  Very nice composition though, good luck.</td>', 'Nice sky but I am not to sure about the highlights in the middle they don''t look quite natural and its a little to dark up front.  Very nice composition though, good luck.', '2006-11-14 16:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3031008, 426633, 46177, '<td valign="top">Love the candid shot and the puddles shining, nice comp. and dof. as well.</td>', 'Love the candid shot and the puddles shining, nice comp. and dof. as well.', '2006-11-14 16:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3031033, 426208, 18367, '<td valign="top">I shall assume by your comment your are stil relatively young, because there truly is nothing barren or empty from old age... or  so I am told.  A very nice image that might have garnered a few more points if you showed  the scene going downhill... and you linked the going downhill to the age factor.(Joking of course) <br/> <br/>Well done, and the best of luck with the "Old Age" crowd...hehehehe.</td>', 'I shall assume by your comment your are stil relatively young, because there truly is nothing barren or empty from old age... or  so I am told.  A very nice image that might have garnered a few more points if you showed  the scene going downhill... and you linked the going downhill to the age factor.(Joking of course)  Well done, and the best of luck with the "Old Age" crowd...hehehehe.', '2006-11-14 16:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3031051, 426445, 64733, '<td valign="top">brilliant action shot and great technicals from my perspective.</td>', 'brilliant action shot and great technicals from my perspective.', '2006-11-14 16:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3031113, 426529, 31443, '<td valign="top">Something nostalgic and sad about this image, the memories of childhood come flooding in. I like the texture specially in the cardigan..</td>', 'Something nostalgic and sad about this image, the memories of childhood come flooding in. I like the texture specially in the cardigan..', '2006-11-14 17:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
