(3032069, 426208, 64176, '<td valign="top">I really like this idea but as a newbie learning about cropping, I would like to see the close cluster of benches on the left and the poles on the right cropped out. I think it would be less busy and the viewer would quickly understand the intention of the picture... and because not all old age is empty and barren, some fitting alternate titles would be "Absence" or a more optimistic one, "Awaiting Return".</td>', 'I really like this idea but as a newbie learning about cropping, I would like to see the close cluster of benches on the left and the poles on the right cropped out. I think it would be less busy and the viewer would quickly understand the intention of the picture... and because not all old age is empty and barren, some fitting alternate titles would be "Absence" or a more optimistic one, "Awaiting Return".', '2006-11-14 22:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
