(3032080, 425658, 67152, '<td valign="top">This photo is excellent - focus, lighting, contrast. The shadows on the buidling and mountains are amazing.  I love how you did not overdo the processing.</td>', 'This photo is excellent - focus, lighting, contrast. The shadows on the buidling and mountains are amazing.  I love how you did not overdo the processing.', '2006-11-14 22:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
