(3032096, 426794, 64176, '<td valign="top">whoa, i''m sure the men will disagree, but that''s a little too much information for me.  you have a beautiful body but this shot could be more elegant if you turned to the left a smidge.  i love the shoes, the shadowing and the umbrella position.  the right bicep is a little too flexed making you look unrelaxed.  and one last thing, i think this picture would look awesome with a light gray background or some fog/mist, suggesting weather appropriate for an umbrella.  good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'whoa, i''m sure the men will disagree, but that''s a little too much information for me.  you have a beautiful body but this shot could be more elegant if you turned to the left a smidge.  i love the shoes, the shadowing and the umbrella position.  the right bicep is a little too flexed making you look unrelaxed.  and one last thing, i think this picture would look awesome with a light gray background or some fog/mist, suggesting weather appropriate for an umbrella.  good luck in the challenge!', '2006-11-14 22:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
