(3032147, 425349, 64176, '<td valign="top">very creative idea and i love the title. i''m wondering what is on the nose of the woman on the left.  it looks like it''s supposed to be her left eyelash, but it looks too low for that and my brain wants to say it''s a small insect. other than that, i love this shot. i like the crop and what amazing clarity in their skin.  you can see the pores and their cheeks look so soft and beautiful. good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'very creative idea and i love the title. i''m wondering what is on the nose of the woman on the left.  it looks like it''s supposed to be her left eyelash, but it looks too low for that and my brain wants to say it''s a small insect. other than that, i love this shot. i like the crop and what amazing clarity in their skin.  you can see the pores and their cheeks look so soft and beautiful. good luck in the challenge!', '2006-11-14 23:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
