(3040658, 426348, 5728, '<td valign="top">Now this is good, I do like the idea. The stuff at the top is too much for me, I would have cropped the whole lot at the top out of this and taken it right down to above the tap, it would have brought in more impact and centered the main focus on the girl. Landscape format. more on the left and less on the right and you have a masterpiece here!</td>', 'Now this is good, I do like the idea. The stuff at the top is too much for me, I would have cropped the whole lot at the top out of this and taken it right down to above the tap, it would have brought in more impact and centered the main focus on the girl. Landscape format. more on the left and less on the right and you have a masterpiece here!', '2006-11-17 16:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040660, 425738, 5728, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, too much room on the right though and needs more on the left!</td>', 'Cool shot, too much room on the right though and needs more on the left!', '2006-11-17 16:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040661, 426310, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good idea but for me the crop is wrong. I would have taken the towers and the wall right over to the left, cut down a little and added more of the houses on the right.</td>', 'Good idea but for me the crop is wrong. I would have taken the towers and the wall right over to the left, cut down a little and added more of the houses on the right.', '2006-11-17 16:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
