(3040675, 425151, 5728, '<td valign="top">Idea is good, composition is good, but the left eye comes over a little too unnaturally for me.</td>', 'Idea is good, composition is good, but the left eye comes over a little too unnaturally for me.', '2006-11-17 16:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040676, 426662, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good :)</td>', 'Good :)', '2006-11-17 16:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040686, 426373, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is good, I like the idea, but somehow the eyes come a little too overprocessed to me, especially on the girl on the right.</td>', 'This is good, I like the idea, but somehow the eyes come a little too overprocessed to me, especially on the girl on the right.', '2006-11-17 16:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040778, 426255, 66515, '<td valign="top">Not bad but this shot could benefit from some straightening. I would also consider cropping it in a bit tighter. With the building on a complete horizontal and nothing but the building and water to look at this would look quite peaceful and serene.</td>', 'Not bad but this shot could benefit from some straightening. I would also consider cropping it in a bit tighter. With the building on a complete horizontal and nothing but the building and water to look at this would look quite peaceful and serene.', '2006-11-17 17:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040802, 426756, 66515, '<td valign="top">I like this picture but I fin the drop shadow border is distracting (I keep looking at the border rather than whats inside of it). If you do opt for a border in the future I would suggest keeping it really simple and plain. <br/> <br/>In terms of the picture itself I like how you used the corner post to tie the image together visually. The fence draws your eye into the picture creating a nice feeling of depth. <br/> <br/>There is some interesting elements in the picture without it being too busy. (the fence, the tree/post, the pair of trees in the background; the nicely contrasted clouds in the sky). <br/>6.</td>', 'I like this picture but I fin the drop shadow border is distracting (I keep looking at the border rather than whats inside of it). If you do opt for a border in the future I would suggest keeping it really simple and plain.  In terms of the picture itself I like how you used the corner post to tie the image together visually. The fence draws your eye into the picture creating a nice feeling of depth.  There is some interesting elements in the picture without it being too busy. (the fence, the tree/post, the pair of trees in the background; the nicely contrasted clouds in the sky). 6.', '2006-11-17 17:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
