(3040992, 425731, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very good, the finger on the door does so much for this image! Brilliant.<br/> <br/>edit:  However this does in the final results I don''t care, but for me this is my favourite of the lot it is excellent work, wonderful composition, lighting and processing. This is one amazing image. I just have to favourite it. Beautiful! I am very much looking forward to seeing who took this! (10)</td>', 'Very good, the finger on the door does so much for this image! Brilliant. edit:  However this does in the final results I don''t care, but for me this is my favourite of the lot it is excellent work, wonderful composition, lighting and processing. This is one amazing image. I just have to favourite it. Beautiful! I am very much looking forward to seeing who took this! (10)', '2006-11-17 18:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
