(3043417, 426113, 23053, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, here.  I have to say that it looks like the Phantom is taking a big bite out of the keyboard, which I''m sure is just my mind playing tricks on me.  The smooth tones and contrast between the many straight lines of the piano with the completely curvy lines of the mask are a nice touch.  Good luck.</td>', 'Interesting shot, here.  I have to say that it looks like the Phantom is taking a big bite out of the keyboard, which I''m sure is just my mind playing tricks on me.  The smooth tones and contrast between the many straight lines of the piano with the completely curvy lines of the mask are a nice touch.  Good luck.', '2006-11-19 09:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
