(3043586, 426072, 67621, '<td valign="top">lovely photo. if i was nitpicking it...i''d like to see the back ground stay dark, as you have it, with a little texture, but to see the wood of the table pop a little more. it looks like it has a nice grain to it, and it would make the rose-wood connection more.</td>', 'lovely photo. if i was nitpicking it...i''d like to see the back ground stay dark, as you have it, with a little texture, but to see the wood of the table pop a little more. it looks like it has a nice grain to it, and it would make the rose-wood connection more.', '2006-11-19 10:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043590, 425512, 67621, '<td valign="top">this one was difficult to appreciate on the dpchallenge page, because of the size it was displayed at. when i opened it as an image alone on the page, i was struck by the correlation of the two focal points.</td>', 'this one was difficult to appreciate on the dpchallenge page, because of the size it was displayed at. when i opened it as an image alone on the page, i was struck by the correlation of the two focal points.', '2006-11-19 10:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
