(3045313, 426084, 41337, '<td valign="top">Man that is a weird sky. Almost looks like giant orb of clouds. Striking nonetheless.</td>', 'Man that is a weird sky. Almost looks like giant orb of clouds. Striking nonetheless.', '2006-11-20 00:29:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(3045336, 426818, 1717, '<td valign="top">hey...i thought you said you didn''t get a shot in on time!  maybe that was a different pic.  anyway...love this one.  gawjus lighting and pose. :)</td>', 'hey...i thought you said you didn''t get a shot in on time!  maybe that was a different pic.  anyway...love this one.  gawjus lighting and pose. :)', '2006-11-20 00:32:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3045346, 426615, 41337, '<td valign="top">Lots of character in this shot. The model almost seems too young for the shot. Not sure if that makes sense but my thinking is had he been older, more bearded and a bit closer the score goes through the roof. Well that''s my lame attempt to critique this. Obviously it scored well as is. Perhaps that black and white ribbon shot is on the horizon.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-20 00:35:16.</i></td>', 'Lots of character in this shot. The model almost seems too young for the shot. Not sure if that makes sense but my thinking is had he been older, more bearded and a bit closer the score goes through the roof. Well that''s my lame attempt to critique this. Obviously it scored well as is. Perhaps that black and white ribbon shot is on the horizon.', '2006-11-20 00:34:18.000000', '2006-11-20 00:35:16.000000', 0),
