(3045438, 425648, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is fascinating. I''ve never heard of this kind of mollusk. Ha, well I''m not exactly an expert on mollusks to begin with. But this thing looks so weird (in a cool way) that I googled it. There are no pictures even close to as interesting as yours. It looks like an eye, mouth, and hairy ear. What a great shot!</td>', 'This is fascinating. I''ve never heard of this kind of mollusk. Ha, well I''m not exactly an expert on mollusks to begin with. But this thing looks so weird (in a cool way) that I googled it. There are no pictures even close to as interesting as yours. It looks like an eye, mouth, and hairy ear. What a great shot!', '2006-11-20 00:44:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3045441, 426084, 22734, '<td valign="top">A spectacular capture. It is like the lighthouse is holding up an umbrella made of clouds. Worthy of the Blue and more! Congratulations.</td>', 'A spectacular capture. It is like the lighthouse is holding up an umbrella made of clouds. Worthy of the Blue and more! Congratulations.', '2006-11-20 00:44:59.000000', NULL, 0),
