(3046610, 424983, 44490, '<td valign="top">I think that this photo is underrated, and that the lighting, while somewhat harsh, is very effective for the striking eyes under the brim of the hat, and the strong feeling that you have captured.  I like it.</td>', 'I think that this photo is underrated, and that the lighting, while somewhat harsh, is very effective for the striking eyes under the brim of the hat, and the strong feeling that you have captured.  I like it.', '2006-11-20 08:20:43.000000', NULL, 0),
