(3046635, 426563, 18339, '<td valign="top">I though for sure this would be in the top three.  Congrats on a super capture, this is very well done.  It would make a great greeting card for valentines day :)</td>', 'I though for sure this would be in the top three.  Congrats on a super capture, this is very well done.  It would make a great greeting card for valentines day :)', '2006-11-20 08:27:44.000000', NULL, 0),
