(3046643, 426071, 44490, '<td valign="top">I think that this image is underrated - it was one of my top picks for the challenge.  I love the combination of straight and curved lines, lacey lattice work, flag flying. I agree with the previous comment that a little work on the shadows and hightlights would help and be more effective.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-20 08:34:10.</i></td>', 'I think that this image is underrated - it was one of my top picks for the challenge.  I love the combination of straight and curved lines, lacey lattice work, flag flying. I agree with the previous comment that a little work on the shadows and hightlights would help and be more effective.', '2006-11-20 08:33:42.000000', '2006-11-20 08:34:10.000000', 0),
(3046646, 424688, 18339, '<td valign="top">I feel like I could reach out and touch this one and would feel a rough texture.  Very nicly done and congrats on your yellow :)</td>', 'I feel like I could reach out and touch this one and would feel a rough texture.  Very nicly done and congrats on your yellow :)', '2006-11-20 08:34:08.000000', NULL, 0),
