(3046662, 426227, 44490, '<td valign="top">An underrated image - I think that you captured the moment, the expression on the boy''s face is perfect, with mum providing reinforcement.  I rated it 9.  Consider cloning out the man in the back under advanced editing.  Thanks for sharing this shot.</td>', 'An underrated image - I think that you captured the moment, the expression on the boy''s face is perfect, with mum providing reinforcement.  I rated it 9.  Consider cloning out the man in the back under advanced editing.  Thanks for sharing this shot.', '2006-11-20 08:38:46.000000', NULL, 0),
