(3047097, 426552, 64571, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all of the great comments.<br/> <br/>As for what happened to his face...<br/> <br/>As I said in the description, this is a silent drill team.  The way they keep "count" is by the lead guy to nod forward when they are ready to make the next change in formations.<br/> <br/>I knew I took a risk by submitting this without his face showing, but I loved the shot so much that I wanted to enter it anyway!</td>', 'Thanks for all of the great comments. As for what happened to his face... As I said in the description, this is a silent drill team.  The way they keep "count" is by the lead guy to nod forward when they are ready to make the next change in formations. I knew I took a risk by submitting this without his face showing, but I loved the shot so much that I wanted to enter it anyway!', '2006-11-20 10:25:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3047099, 425734, 42013, '<td valign="top">One of the best ones. Love the perspective and the HDR treatment. Great leading lines right on out to Toronto''s version of the Space Needle. Congrats.</td>', 'One of the best ones. Love the perspective and the HDR treatment. Great leading lines right on out to Toronto''s version of the Space Needle. Congrats.', '2006-11-20 10:26:03.000000', NULL, 0),
