(3047712, 426599, 57421, '<td valign="top">I think this is definitely underrated. However, I whish there had been a bit more editing around contrast/highlights (face) etc. and I would have preferred the #3 outtake, with the open umbrella, a bit more dynamic/fun.<br/>But in any case an underrated, original composition. the opposition between the clothes colors, the background, the head, is really nice.</td>', 'I think this is definitely underrated. However, I whish there had been a bit more editing around contrast/highlights (face) etc. and I would have preferred the #3 outtake, with the open umbrella, a bit more dynamic/fun.But in any case an underrated, original composition. the opposition between the clothes colors, the background, the head, is really nice.', '2006-11-20 13:18:14.000000', NULL, 0),
