(3048068, 425795, 67001, '<td valign="top">I am not going to ''review'' your photo, because it will be very similar to everyone else''s comments. I just want to say that your picture makes me kinda sad. When I was born until I was 14 years old we had 2 poodles. Saki was the oldest one and my favorite. Over the years she went blind and had to be held to go to the bathroom (she lost motricity in her back legs). We had to put her down. Your dog really looks like my Saki and it brings back memories. I know how you must feel about the picture rating so low. But don''t worry, people were rating the PHOTO and not your DOG!<br/> <br/>Thanks for your entry. Have fun on the site...</td>', 'I am not going to ''review'' your photo, because it will be very similar to everyone else''s comments. I just want to say that your picture makes me kinda sad. When I was born until I was 14 years old we had 2 poodles. Saki was the oldest one and my favorite. Over the years she went blind and had to be held to go to the bathroom (she lost motricity in her back legs). We had to put her down. Your dog really looks like my Saki and it brings back memories. I know how you must feel about the picture rating so low. But don''t worry, people were rating the PHOTO and not your DOG! Thanks for your entry. Have fun on the site...', '2006-11-20 15:25:22.000000', NULL, 0),
