(3049503, 426701, 65319, '<td valign="top">What I love about this charming photo is the black moss dripping down from the branches against the white almost airbrushed feel of the flowing stream below.  The busy dense underbrush in the background is a bit distracting and lends a more ordinary quality to an otherwise extraordinary photo.  The cropping is rather artistic and draws the eye directly to the center of the photo and down.  I can''t help but wonder...are those water sprites in the water or just your photo capturing my imagination?  Well done.</td>', 'What I love about this charming photo is the black moss dripping down from the branches against the white almost airbrushed feel of the flowing stream below.  The busy dense underbrush in the background is a bit distracting and lends a more ordinary quality to an otherwise extraordinary photo.  The cropping is rather artistic and draws the eye directly to the center of the photo and down.  I can''t help but wonder...are those water sprites in the water or just your photo capturing my imagination?  Well done.', '2006-11-20 23:42:32.000000', NULL, 0),
