(3050714, 425734, 35357, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mpeters:</b></div><hr/><i> One of the best ones. Love the perspective and the HDR treatment. Great leading lines right on out to Toronto''s version of the Space Needle. Congrats. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks.  Here''s a piece of trivia for anyone that might bother to read this....<br/> <br/>The CN Tower is three times taller than the Space Needle, at 1815 feet compared to 605 feet.  If the Space Needle were standing where the CN Tower was for this photo, it would have been obscured by the tree in the centre of the road and probably not shown up at all.<br/> <br/>Here are some numbers to put things into perspective:<br/> <br/>1815 feet = CN Tower<br/>1670 feet = Taipei 101<br/>1483 feet = Petronas Towers 1 &amp; 2<br/>1450 feet = Sears Tower<br/>1250 feet = Empire State Building<br/> 605 feet = Space Needle<br/> <br/>I guess you might say Torontonians really feel the need to overcomphensate. ;-)</td>', 'Originally posted by mpeters: One of the best ones. Love the perspective and the HDR treatment. Great leading lines right on out to Toronto''s version of the Space Needle. Congrats.  Thanks.  Here''s a piece of trivia for anyone that might bother to read this.... The CN Tower is three times taller than the Space Needle, at 1815 feet compared to 605 feet.  If the Space Needle were standing where the CN Tower was for this photo, it would have been obscured by the tree in the centre of the road and probably not shown up at all. Here are some numbers to put things into perspective: 1815 feet = CN Tower1670 feet = Taipei 1011483 feet = Petronas Towers 1 & 21450 feet = Sears Tower1250 feet = Empire State Building 605 feet = Space Needle I guess you might say Torontonians really feel the need to overcomphensate. ;-)', '2006-11-21 13:23:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(3050878, 426379, 56031, '<td valign="top">I sure thought this would get a better score than it did... I guess the sharpness really kicked my butt. anyway..I guess I am destined to stay in the below 5 club.</td>', 'I sure thought this would get a better score than it did... I guess the sharpness really kicked my butt. anyway..I guess I am destined to stay in the below 5 club.', '2006-11-21 14:37:38.000000', NULL, 0),
