(3051327, 424688, 19708, '<td valign="top">Besides all the fanfare, confetti falling and ticker-tape parade for winning your first ribbon, I wanted to say what an absolutely amazing image this is and what a superlative job on the post-processing.<br/>This picture has a genuine, timeless quality about it and can see this standing the test of time and having all the wow factor 100 years from now - a shot I would be proud as hell to have taken.<br/></td>', 'Besides all the fanfare, confetti falling and ticker-tape parade for winning your first ribbon, I wanted to say what an absolutely amazing image this is and what a superlative job on the post-processing.This picture has a genuine, timeless quality about it and can see this standing the test of time and having all the wow factor 100 years from now - a shot I would be proud as hell to have taken.', '2006-11-21 17:17:05.000000', NULL, 0),
