(3057499, 426084, 32885, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the blue. Your photo has made me incredibly homesick. I used to go to Vaucluse Boys High School situated about 400m from the light house. The Macquarie Lighthouse was our school emblem and our motto ''Lumen Scientia''. I am writing this from an incredibly crappy place in Iraq. When I come home next year I''ll resume my interrupted photography learning. Congrats again and well done.</td>', 'Congrats on the blue. Your photo has made me incredibly homesick. I used to go to Vaucluse Boys High School situated about 400m from the light house. The Macquarie Lighthouse was our school emblem and our motto ''Lumen Scientia''. I am writing this from an incredibly crappy place in Iraq. When I come home next year I''ll resume my interrupted photography learning. Congrats again and well done.', '2006-11-23 12:04:19.000000', NULL, 0),
