(3060833, 426651, 32997, '<td valign="top">Voter:<i> Why a goat?</i> <br/>Photographer:<i> It was there.</i> <br/>V: <i>Couldn''t you find a beautiful model, and set it up so we could stare at her eyes and tell you it is a beautiful photograph?</i> <br/>P: <i>I didn''t see that...</i> <br/>V: <i>But how can you get the score you NEED if you take a picture of  a goat?</i> <br/>P: <i>I can''t...</i> <br/>V: <i>Then why did you take this shot?</i> <br/>P: <i>It was there..</i>.<br/> <br/>(I am glad it was there...beautiful model!)</td>', 'Voter: Why a goat? Photographer: It was there. V: Couldn''t you find a beautiful model, and set it up so we could stare at her eyes and tell you it is a beautiful photograph? P: I didn''t see that... V: But how can you get the score you NEED if you take a picture of  a goat? P: I can''t... V: Then why did you take this shot? P: It was there... (I am glad it was there...beautiful model!)', '2006-11-25 01:26:12.000000', NULL, 0),
