(3067577, 426556, 67844, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the feedback. I too wish this photo would have placed higher but being my second entry, I didn''t expect too much. I am still learning how to do this thing called photography. <br/> <br/>Some additional notes on the photo:<br/>I took this photo the last day of the challenge. I was hanging out at a friends house and thought the bonsai on the table was kinda cool. So I grabbed my camera but did not have my tripod. I burst about 10 photos in landscape and 10 more in portrait. I did not get any other angles. So the way I look at it, the photo came out pretty good.</td>', 'Thanks for the feedback. I too wish this photo would have placed higher but being my second entry, I didn''t expect too much. I am still learning how to do this thing called photography.  Some additional notes on the photo:I took this photo the last day of the challenge. I was hanging out at a friends house and thought the bonsai on the table was kinda cool. So I grabbed my camera but did not have my tripod. I burst about 10 photos in landscape and 10 more in portrait. I did not get any other angles. So the way I look at it, the photo came out pretty good.', '2006-11-28 02:58:01.000000', NULL, 0),
