(3067721, 426406, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like the graphic quality of this.  the white block forces me around it up into the smaller and smaller boxes of road until I am stuck at the top left in a new type of box.  No choice but to move up and out - excellent flow to that.</td>', 'I like the graphic quality of this.  the white block forces me around it up into the smaller and smaller boxes of road until I am stuck at the top left in a new type of box.  No choice but to move up and out - excellent flow to that.', '2006-11-28 07:02:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3067759, 426757, 34192, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to think of who this reminds me of and its there and not there.  1950''s, painter... it''ll come to me someday in an AHA moment.  I rather like it.  Fits the challenge but the voters always want something in thier face.  Excellent work and mind as usual. :)</td>', 'I''m trying to think of who this reminds me of and its there and not there.  1950''s, painter... it''ll come to me someday in an AHA moment.  I rather like it.  Fits the challenge but the voters always want something in thier face.  Excellent work and mind as usual. :)', '2006-11-28 07:25:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3067838, 426153, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like this image.  Its real life the way it really is.  Real.  This is something I''ve never seen before, particularly from this angle.  Had I voted in this challenge, it would have gotten at least a 7.  I''ve seen enough neat imaged, saturated pretty girls and landscapes on this site to do me for a lifetime.  I want raw and real.  For those of you that find it unappealing, well, much of life is that way.  The composition is excellent, the DOF works for the image (and situation), the toning also works well for the subject. Well done!</td>', 'I like this image.  Its real life the way it really is.  Real.  This is something I''ve never seen before, particularly from this angle.  Had I voted in this challenge, it would have gotten at least a 7.  I''ve seen enough neat imaged, saturated pretty girls and landscapes on this site to do me for a lifetime.  I want raw and real.  For those of you that find it unappealing, well, much of life is that way.  The composition is excellent, the DOF works for the image (and situation), the toning also works well for the subject. Well done!', '2006-11-28 08:27:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3068073, 426305, 23484, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the two comments.  The highlights were not blown out like that in the original. I did that purposly trying to achieve a white on white but I guess it didn''t work too well.</td>', 'Thanks for the two comments.  The highlights were not blown out like that in the original. I did that purposly trying to achieve a white on white but I guess it didn''t work too well.', '2006-11-28 11:02:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3068472, 426305, 30982, '<td valign="top">Blown, schmown.  I happen to like blown highlights and this is a wonderful picture, in my opinion.  It has a longing, but not a sad longing, to it.  It''s very pure - a dog and his window.  It doesn''t get much better than that in life.</td>', 'Blown, schmown.  I happen to like blown highlights and this is a wonderful picture, in my opinion.  It has a longing, but not a sad longing, to it.  It''s very pure - a dog and his window.  It doesn''t get much better than that in life.', '2006-11-28 14:46:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3069091, 426529, 57886, '<td valign="top">This doll could probably tell a good story about her long life :o)Nice texture Gudrun, and there is something about the bw work and the crop that I really like. IMHO the fact that there is only one hand in the picture really suits the "story" in the picture...</td>', 'This doll could probably tell a good story about her long life :o)Nice texture Gudrun, and there is something about the bw work and the crop that I really like. IMHO the fact that there is only one hand in the picture really suits the "story" in the picture...', '2006-11-28 19:41:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(3069473, 426529, 15711, '<td valign="top">Technically, this is really well done. Great contrast and focus.  But it''s not sweet and pretty so DPCers don''t like it. It''s a shame - I think it''s good.</td>', 'Technically, this is really well done. Great contrast and focus.  But it''s not sweet and pretty so DPCers don''t like it. It''s a shame - I think it''s good.', '2006-11-28 22:29:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3070545, 425694, 37858, '<td valign="top">The lower portion of the photo is a reflection of the background stripes on a polished granite kitchen counter, not an edit or a clone.  It doesn''t line up because it was never intended to line up.  I can see how it would puzzle viewers.  I just liked the effect, so I kept it in the photo rather than cropping it out.  Thanks for the comments.</td>', 'The lower portion of the photo is a reflection of the background stripes on a polished granite kitchen counter, not an edit or a clone.  It doesn''t line up because it was never intended to line up.  I can see how it would puzzle viewers.  I just liked the effect, so I kept it in the photo rather than cropping it out.  Thanks for the comments.', '2006-11-29 02:22:01.000000', NULL, 0),
