(3085405, 426751, 30982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot of that gorgeous young man of yours.  I''ll buck the DPC voter trend and say that the high key works REALLY nicely here.  Definitely a keeper.  The kid, too.  You should keep the kid, too.  More photo ops, you know...  :-)</td>', 'Beautiful shot of that gorgeous young man of yours.  I''ll buck the DPC voter trend and say that the high key works REALLY nicely here.  Definitely a keeper.  The kid, too.  You should keep the kid, too.  More photo ops, you know...  :-)', '2006-12-04 01:50:16.000000', NULL, 0),
