(3099154, 426595, 17420, '<td valign="top">I love this picture. I got stopped at the stop sign nearby and I couldn''t help but look around at this spot. I almost got out and took a picture myself, but someone pulled up beind me and I figured I shouldn''t block traffic to copy your shot!</td>', 'I love this picture. I got stopped at the stop sign nearby and I couldn''t help but look around at this spot. I almost got out and took a picture myself, but someone pulled up beind me and I figured I shouldn''t block traffic to copy your shot!', '2006-12-08 05:55:56.000000', NULL, 0),
