(3301180, 426526, 59415, '<td valign="top">This is a very underated shot.  The more you look at it the more you enjoy it.</td>', 'This is a very underated shot.  The more you look at it the more you enjoy it.', '2007-01-29 23:08:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3304325, 426401, 68504, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Wonderful subjects (no artifice in evidence) stand out against muted but defined background.  Also fits my Platonic Idea of what a photo is.  (Not sure about the frame: I''d opt for something more classic like white or black; the grey seems to merge with tree trunk on the right).  (Disagree that it needs more contrast; the contrast is there where it belongs, in the subjects). At least an 8.</td>', 'Great shot.  Wonderful subjects (no artifice in evidence) stand out against muted but defined background.  Also fits my Platonic Idea of what a photo is.  (Not sure about the frame: I''d opt for something more classic like white or black; the grey seems to merge with tree trunk on the right).  (Disagree that it needs more contrast; the contrast is there where it belongs, in the subjects). At least an 8.', '2007-01-30 19:13:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(3304510, 425734, 71664, '<td valign="top">You managed to capture a photo that emits so much texture, its great!<br/> <br/>TDot!</td>', 'You managed to capture a photo that emits so much texture, its great! TDot!', '2007-01-30 20:24:53.000000', NULL, 0),
