(3348907, 426694, 26045, '<td valign="top">!!!! what a photo !!!! you have great vision...which is the most important aspect of photography, yep. i''m really struck by this.</td>', '!!!! what a photo !!!! you have great vision...which is the most important aspect of photography, yep. i''m really struck by this.', '2007-02-09 19:22:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(3353082, 423783, 73414, '<td valign="top">This picture is so cool. I feel this way often, It''s so cool. Yet another emotion put into an image. GREAT WORK!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-02-11 13:44:34.</i></td>', 'This picture is so cool. I feel this way often, It''s so cool. Yet another emotion put into an image. GREAT WORK!', '2007-02-11 13:43:59.000000', '2007-02-11 13:44:34.000000', 0),
(3359559, 426744, 48471, '<td valign="top">I like how there isn''t a sharp defined horizon, how the reflections are blurred, while the subjects are sharp (maybe too sharp?), and how the coldness of the colours make me feel calm while watching this photo. Now, as for the subjects, I think there are too many and too scattered away, but the good thing is that they are too small. And the best thing is that there''s a big piece of something there on the right, so that it doesn''t let my attention go completely off.</td>', 'I like how there isn''t a sharp defined horizon, how the reflections are blurred, while the subjects are sharp (maybe too sharp?), and how the coldness of the colours make me feel calm while watching this photo. Now, as for the subjects, I think there are too many and too scattered away, but the good thing is that they are too small. And the best thing is that there''s a big piece of something there on the right, so that it doesn''t let my attention go completely off.', '2007-02-12 23:54:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3373986, 426464, 70828, '<td valign="top">Lovely, lovely, lovely!</td>', 'Lovely, lovely, lovely!', '2007-02-16 22:13:28.000000', NULL, 0),
