(3960067, 424641, 63267, '<td valign="top">I think you have a great idea and a great image here. I am surprised it didn''t score better in the challenge. Perhaps because it was US currency and this is sucha  diverse international audience that may not know about the old wheat pennies.<br/> <br/>Still a great shot and one to be proud of despite the score in the lower 5.</td>', 'I think you have a great idea and a great image here. I am surprised it didn''t score better in the challenge. Perhaps because it was US currency and this is sucha  diverse international audience that may not know about the old wheat pennies. Still a great shot and one to be proud of despite the score in the lower 5.', '2007-08-02 01:22:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(3971835, 426563, 48697, '<td valign="top">Just saw this shot for the first time and it''s awsome. I''m gonna have to see the other 25 that topped you in this challenge.  Also, this is one of the best episodes in comedic tv of all time, nice pick!</td>', 'Just saw this shot for the first time and it''s awsome. I''m gonna have to see the other 25 that topped you in this challenge.  Also, this is one of the best episodes in comedic tv of all time, nice pick!', '2007-08-05 22:52:23.000000', NULL, 0),
